            "Backfeed, generator, battery, capacitor, and stored energy controlled",
            "Ladder, lift, roof, shaft, and elevated-work exposures controlled",
            "Excavation, utility locate, concrete encasement, and access controlled",
            "Dust, silica, lead, asbestos, firestop, and occupied-area routes addressed",
            "Energization boundary, communication, and emergency response confirmed"
